    {"dot":"cyan","title":"B03a1 scope (consultation lifecycle)","items":["Part of B03-consultation-core split (consultation module 108 routes/11 controllers). B03a1 groups core lifecycle controllers: ConsultationController, ConsultationLifecycleEventsController, ConsultationJobController.","Representative routes: GET workflows/:id/workflow, POST :id/start|pause|stop|approve, GET :id/encounters/:id/recording; SSE GET :id/live-summary/stream, :id/live-assist/stream, :id/events; jobs GET/PATCH /consultations/jobs/:jobId and GET :jobId/stream (SSE).","ConsultationController has many additional context/summary/highlight/entity/timeline routes (inventory 108 total for module); grouped for readability. SSE/internal surfaces captured explicitly."]},
    {"dot":"violet","title":"Example input/output (representative)","items":["Lifecycle command: POST /consultations/:id/start|pause|stop|approve -> consultation/encounter lifecycle state response (vocabulary may depend on X-Hope-Lifecycle header/interceptor).","Live streams: GET :id/live-summary/stream or :id/live-assist/stream (SSE) -> event stream frames (PHI-safe/clinical content per implementation). GET :id/events SSE -> lifecycle event stream.","Jobs: GET /consultations/jobs/:jobId -> job status/result metadata; PATCH cancel -> cancellation result; GET :jobId/stream SSE -> job progress/result events. Verify exact DTOs and SSE event schemas."]},
    {"dot":"emerald","title":"Evidence and limitations","items":["Repo https://github.com/ArcaAI/project-hope.git @ 8cb2e5e8e6bbddf5ee7c676782ebb5ad683c23a0. Controller/service sources verified in local tree.","Downstreams evidenced in ConsultationController deps: consultation/lifecycle services, note generation, live documentation/harness/assist, Redis subscriber for trajectory/SSE relays, workflow/consultation job services, media service for recordings. Exact runtime topology (workers/queues/AI providers) may vary.","Limitations: grouped endpoint nodes (not 1:1 for all consultation.controller routes); ConsultationController is large and has base-pattern/custom routes not fully enumerated by simple grep; example I/O summarized; SSE payload schemas and internal auth are implementation-specific."]}
